# Upload filter for `gcloud builds submit`. Independent of .gitignore so a
# dependency or Android tree is not sent to Cloud Build.
#
# Keep the Docker build inputs: Dockerfile, package-lock.json, apps/api,
# apps/web source, packages, and prompts. The image compiles the SPA itself.
#
# A pattern with no slash matches in every directory. Root-only trees are
# anchored (`/data`, `/docs`, ...) so a source directory of the same name is
# still uploaded. `apps/api/src/data` was dropped when `data` was unanchored,
# and the image then built without the seed and wger importer. Recursive
# excludes (node_modules, coverage, env files, logs) stay unanchored on purpose.

/.git
/.github
/.cursor
/.claude
/.windsurf
node_modules
**/node_modules
/apps/android
coverage
**/coverage
/data
/apps/api/uploads
/apps/api/.data
**/.data
/apps/web/dist
.env
.env.*
*.log
/docs
/design
/content
/evals
/tools
/cloudflare
